* NADOC C3 thiolate linker and restrained graphene-wall parameters
*

BONDS
ON2  CT2         340.0000    1.4300

ANGLES
CT2 ON2 P       20.0000  120.0000  35.0000  2.3300
HA2 CT2 ON2     60.0000  109.5000
CT2 CT2 ON2     75.7000  110.1000

DIHEDRALS
X    CT2 ON2 X   0.2000    3       0.00
ON2  P   ON2 CT2  1.2000    1     180.00
