IMPROPERS

! NGRC is a neutral restrained wall site. Its cross interactions retain CHARMM CA
! epsilon/Rmin; it is deliberately distinct from CA in proteins. No bonded graphene
! terms are present, so wall-wall LJ must be suppressed explicitly at lattice spacing.
NONBONDED
NGRC  0.000000  -0.070000  1.992400

NBFIX
! type1 type2 epsilon Rmin epsilon14 Rmin14
NGRC NGRC  0.000000  3.984800  0.000000  3.984800

